  "id": "cardiology.arterial-pulse.resting-adult",
  "name": "Resting adult arterial pulse events",
  "summary": "Cardiac ejection launches arterial pulse waves that propagate through the vascular system. This record represents their population-level resting-adult recurrence as an event-rate range rather than inventing a beat-to-beat frequency track.",
